---
// Campaign2Hero.astro
---

<header class="relative pt-12 pb-20 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28 bg-white overflow-hidden" id="hero">
  <!-- Dynamic grid background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-60"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-600 font-bold text-sm mb-6 border border-red-100 shadow-sm mx-auto">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-pulse" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
      </svg>
      The notice trigger most founders miss
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      GST↔ITR mismatch has become one of the <span class="text-red-600 relative inline-block">biggest reasons<svg class="absolute w-full h-3 -bottom-1 left-0 text-red-200 -z-10" viewBox="0 0 100 10" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/></svg></span> businesses get tax notices.
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Your GST turnover and your income-tax turnover are meant to match. The government now checks automatically. When they don't agree, your PAN gets flagged. Most of the time it isn't evasion, it's just books nobody reconciled.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-8">
      <a href="#hero-form" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-slate-900/20">
        Check if you're exposed, free
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
        CA-led
      </span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
        300+ businesses
      </span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
        Your Tally data stays in India
      </span>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</header>
